8	Angle of Elevation	\N	\N	The angle of elevation is the angle formed between the horizontal line and the line of sight when an observer looks upward at an object. It is commonly used to determine the height of inaccessible objects.	ai	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	11	2026-07-05 14:58:13.605617	2026-07-05 14:58:13.605624
